#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_roas.ipynb:110002
#: db69064f1e654188ac8ae4384101612c
msgid ""
"We are interested in the effect of the `x1` and `x2` channels on the `y` "
"variable. We have additional covariates like yearly seasonality and a "
"non-linear trend component. In addition, there is an unobserved "
"confounder `z` that affects both the channels and the target variable. "
"This variable introduces a bias in the estimates if we do not account for"
" it. However, for this problem we are going to assume that we do not have"
" access to the `z` variable (hence, unobserved)."
msgstr ""
"Nos interesa el efecto de los canales `x1` y `x2` sobre la variable `y`. "
"Tenemos covariables adicionales, como la estacionalidad anual y un "
"componente de tendencia no lineal. Además, hay un confusor no observado `z` "
"que afecta tanto a los canales como a la variable objetivo. Esta variable "
"introduce un sesgo en las estimaciones si no la tenemos en cuenta. Sin "
"embargo, para este problema vamos a suponer que no tenemos acceso a la "
"variable `z` (por lo tanto, no observada)."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_roas.ipynb:110004
#: bbb72785aac54a84bc3888737ff002b7
msgid ""
"In the `raw_df` we have all the columns needed in the data generating "
"process to obtain the target variable `y`. For example, the "
"`x1_adstock_saturated` column is the result of applying the adstock "
"function and then the saturation to the `x1` channel."
msgstr ""
"En el `raw_df` tenemos todas las columnas necesarias en el proceso de "
"generación de datos para obtener la variable objetivo `y`. Por ejemplo, la "
"columna `x1_adstock_saturated` es el resultado de aplicar la función de "
"adstock y luego la saturación al canal `x1`."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_roas.ipynb:110006
#: 1ab0edc9c3684070b2844457b800da74
msgid "The target variable `y` is generated as"
msgstr "La variable objetivo `y` se genera como"

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_roas.ipynb:110012
#: e1cf47548913473a921aa7bcbd6016b9
msgid "where `epsilon` is a Gaussian noise and `amplitude` is set to $100$."
msgstr ""
"donde `epsilon` es un ruido gaussiano y `amplitude` se establece en $100$."

#: ../source/notebooks/mmm/mmm_roas.ipynb:110014
#: 3f84748edd134d3c979ee13ebc8953f9
msgid ""
"The variables `y01` and `y02` are the target variable `y` without the "
